+- Section date (2026-11-26) and the "once that lands" wording about hg-lnw.7 are written as of the pin commit and then amended with later facts; the section reads coherently at head.
+- Daemon-side claims (store schema 19, authority rules, 24 h and 7 d windows, 3.6.0 U1/U2) cite herdr-threads source at tags and could not be re-derived from the graph diff; the vendored tree at 3.6.0 is consistent with them where sampled.
